CLUSTER: AUTONOMOUS-TICKET-RUNNER (2/3) — siblings WORK-GATEWAY-WIRE, WORK-LAND-PR;
cross-ref WORK-OBSERVABILITY (capturing the agent's work is its sub-goal 2).

